{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d64166aa1a465a35144be82af4f9e4776593b442b012fab637d928226ead5daa", "ja": "（ひな祭りをお祝いするイベントに出演したひなた。\nお雛様に扮した姿も可愛らしかったな。……おや？）", "zh": "（日向参加了庆祝女儿节的活动。\n她扮成女儿节人偶的样子也可爱极了。……咦？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1001_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "8f1ef147c2a8a0ca762af722c9c7445facd162d1b4524b48c1490950b0b65f3c", "ja": "お姉ちゃんのおひなさま、すっごくかわいかった！\nほんとうにおひめさまみたいだったよ。", "zh": "姐姐的人偶娃娃，超级可爱！\n真的就像公主一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "5d3dcfb1922fb52660daaedc63b382102183c17d39a03bace52e025ab5d35be4", "ja": "えへへ……ありがとねぇ。\nお姉ちゃん、とってもうれしいよぉ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢你呀。\n姐姐特别开心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1003_onnanoko", "source_sha256": "0a2683912985ea68658cda03b59668f8c90d29ef0811691011663e7417b8caa2", "ja": "えへへ♪　ねえねえ。私も、お姉ちゃんみたいな\nかわいいおひなさまになれるかな～？", "zh": "诶嘿嘿♪ 呐呐，我也能变成像姐姐那样可爱的女儿节人偶吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "304da8ea2e7949923441e926e65eb355fd5ea6fa183b1398e2c546e86dea49a1", "ja": "大丈夫だよぉ。いつか、お姉ちゃんと一緒に\nかわいいお雛様になって、みんなに見てもらうべさ♪", "zh": "没事的啦。总有一天，你会和姐姐一起\n变成可爱的雏人偶，让大家都来看看的呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2980c4e5716e5c474be7d4ef4de4b9ca043b29a3966a307bf54bd95a456da0ee", "ja": "お疲れ様、ひなた。\n女の子とずいぶん盛り上がってたな。", "zh": "辛苦了，日向。\n和那个女孩聊得很开心嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "0660361df684ac807558a4610ac8a21118ed1edb3c3b22a51fe9c07496928693", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。えっとね……えへへ。\n実はあの子、あたしに憧れてくれたみたいなんだぁ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。那个……嘿嘿。其实，那个孩子好像很憧憬我呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "488123e8c4a0c5629761977a14c69bd112cc900bf9ce6faac497a0756eb13f9f", "ja": "お雛様姿が、すごくキラキラしてたんだって。\nそれで、声をかけてくれたみたい。", "zh": "听说我穿着雏人偶装的样子，特别闪闪发光。\n所以，她好像就主动来跟我搭话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f48f5674b273c009d0e31640047f21ba18196b890b4c2265e1910565776d7d63", "ja": "へぇ、よかったじゃないか。その子が\n夢中になるくらい、ひなたが輝いて見えたんだな。", "zh": "哦，那不是挺好的吗？能让那个孩子着迷到这种程度，说明在她眼里，日向一定特别闪耀吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "12dd00225171c15bcefbbc647d31edbe91bbe4d1cd5587a98dc25769ed7e0bd1", "ja": "そ、そっか。他のアイドルさん達も、\nかわいかったり、キレイなお雛様だったのに……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊。其他偶像们也都变成了可爱又漂亮的女儿节人偶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "733c977b61c03a06c8da2d9df64afc5fa4a53b5baed0cb76e1cde1159a4cfbd5", "ja": "その中で、あたしを気に入ってくれるなんて\nなまらうれしいべさ♪", "zh": "在那么多可爱又漂亮的雏人偶中，你能喜欢上我，真的特别开心呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "5972bbecee9e0518d34f317e37e155757054ff75f76dacb72aa6a70565554a94", "ja": "……あのね、{$P$}。あたし、\n約束したんだ。あの子と一緒にお雛様になろうねって。", "zh": "……那个，{$P$}。我啊，和那孩子约好了，要一起成为女儿节人偶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cf881727189c0a218ce770f5f6d3f676d2099b06ebb788ef6b02dad2bf1b5e98", "ja": "一緒にお雛様に……か。素敵な夢じゃないか。\nいつか叶うといいな、その約束。", "zh": "一起成为女儿节人偶啊……真是个美好的梦想。\n希望那份约定终有一天能够实现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "2456b26e87d892258babed1073f1385c9e9e11f77713b1bc3152e252f183b77a", "ja": "うん！　したっけ、あたしももっと頑張るよ！\nあの子が憧れてくれるアイドルでいられるように。", "zh": "嗯！这样的话，我也要更加努力了！  \n为了继续成为那个孩子所憧憬的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "12b5835964031bb9a24d7477136485596138e02fe7dbb6d25cdd3503c8a0632b", "ja": "きっとあの子は、素敵なお雛様になると思うんだ。\nだからあたしも……負けてられないべさ！", "zh": "我觉得，那孩子一定会成为一个很棒的雏人偶。  \n所以我也……可不能输给她呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1015_p", "source_sha256": "65621ef39fdd4909b1f55ce87f3e25f2bcfb84cc48764545bfc9fa4810fba8ea", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。\nひなたとあの子の夢が叶うように、全力で協力するよ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得对。为了让日向和那孩子的梦想实现，我会全力帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0513_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "5e42a16acb4140823c69b429828b41ec7f09503e321edf7a8b746b192a16db11", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}。アイドルとして\n成長できるように、これからもよろしくね♪", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}。为了能作为偶像不断成长，今后也请多多关照哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
